      "value": "I’m experiencing the same issue. I send `/usercamera/LookAtMeXOffset` via OSC with a value of `10`, but I receive return packets for both `/usercamera/LookAtMeXOffset` = `10` and `/usercamera/LookAtMeYOffset` = `10`.\n\nIn-game, the camera only responds to `LookAtMeXOffset` correctly—the problem is only with the returned OSC packets.",
